# Observability and evals

For important agent runs, capture (privacy-safe) when extending telemetry:

- correlation / conversation ID; agency or clinic tenant; environment
- workflow; model; prompt/rule version
- tool calls, durations, outcomes; validation failures; retries
- latency; tokens; estimated cost when available
- final structured state; recommendation rejection reasons; fallback usage

Do **not** log secrets or unnecessary sensitive patient data. Prefer extending `aiGateway` usage records over ad-hoc logging.

## Eval categories (automate where relevant)

Language consistency; treatment/city extraction; location/side eligibility; allowlist / max recommendation count **when defined by policy**; repeated-question prevention; pricing hallucination; clinic selection; lead/quote creation; appointment updates; email truthfulness; tenant isolation; tool-failure recovery.

A single demo conversation ≠ success. Prefer regression tests (`tests/**`, Vitest).
